🎬 7 WONDERS — STORY & CHARACTERS

🇮🇳 TAJ MAHAL

⭐ 7 WONDERS STORY CONCEPT

🌍 WORLD SETUP

Taj Mahal DreamVerse mein ek recognizable tourist landmark rahega. Iske aas-paas Agra city recreate nahi ki jayegi. Taj Mahal khud ek dedicated ghoomne aur exploration ki jagah hoga.

🌴 ACHABARA ISLAND

Story ke liye ek alag location Achabara Island rahegi. Ye Taj Mahal se separate location hogi aur iska apna environment, characters aur events honge.

👥 TWO SEPARATE GROUPS

Story mein do alag groups/families honge. Dono ke apne-apne areas aur territories honge. Starting mein dono groups ke beech koi purani dushmani nahi hogi. Dono groups ek-doosre ko properly jaante bhi nahi honge.

🎮 PLAYER ROLE

Player main hero nahi hoga. Player ka koi fixed dialogue nahi hoga. Player free movement ke saath world mein jahan chahe ghoom sakta hai.

Player ke mind mein jo question aaye, woh NPC se voice system ke through pooch sakta hai. Question button press karne par NPC ka answer voice mein sunai dega.

Story player ko ek fixed path par force nahi karegi. Player story events ko naturally discover karega—kabhi ghoomte-ghoomte, kabhi kisi NPC se information lekar aur kabhi kisi situation mein accidentally involve hokar.

💥 MAIN STORY IDEA

Player starting mein Dada Ji se nahi milega. Sabse pehle player doosre bade group ki badi gang se milega. Ye gang size mein Dada Ji ki trusted gang se kaafi badi hogi.

Dono groups ke beech pehle se koi rivalry nahi hogi. Player ki baatein, actions, misunderstandings aur situations ke through dheere-dheere dono groups ke beech dushmani create hogi.

Player ko khud bhi initially nahi pata hoga ki uski chhoti-chhoti actions future mein kitna bada conflict create karengi.

👴 DADA JI

🇮🇳 SARDAR DHAKAD SINGH 💪

Role: Main elder aur family head.

Personality: Dabang presence, desi attitude, caring nature aur strong comedy timing.

Dada Ji ki apni ek chhoti trusted gang hogi. Unki gang family ke har member ki tarah huge nahi hogi; ye unke saath ghoomne aur situations handle karne wali close team hogi.

🚗 DADA JI ENTRY

Dada Ji ki entry mein 3 gaadiyan hongi.

🚙 Left — Gang ki gaadi
🚘 Centre — Dada Ji ki main gaadi
🚙 Right — Gang ki gaadi

Dada Ji centre wali gaadi ke bonnet par relaxed style mein baithe/lete hue entry karenge. Gaadi rukegi, Dada Ji bonnet se uthkar neeche aayenge aur unki gang dono taraf position legi.

Us moment par poori situation serious-looking aur comedy tone dono rakhegi.

Dada Ji ka first major encounter tab hoga jab ek situation ke baad woh scene par pahunchte hain aur player wahan se bhaagkar doosri side chala jaata hai.

🏠 PLAYER — DADA JI HOUSE ENCOUNTER

Player bhaagte-bhaagte Dada Ji ke ghar pahunch jaata hai. Ghar mein aaye hue guest ko maarna allowed nahi hoga, kyunki desi culture mein ghar aaye mehmaan ko bhagwan ke samaan maana jaata hai.

Isliye family player ko maarne ke bajay comedy ke saath ghar se bahar nikalne ki koshish karegi.

Player bahar nikal jaata hai. Is encounter ke baad player aur Dada Ji ke beech dheere-dheere desi friendship develop hogi.

😂 COMEDY DIRECTION

Comedy situations se naturally niklegi. Player ki chhoti actions se misunderstandings badhengi, groups ek-doosre ko galat samjhenge aur Dada Ji ki gang serious situations ko apne desi style mein handle karegi.

Player ko direct villain ya mastermind declare nahi kiya jayega. Uski actions story ke conflict ko naturally create karengi.

👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 DADA JI FAMILY

Dada Ji ki huge Punjabi-style family ghar par rahegi. Puri family har scene mein nahi aayegi. Family ke members apne ghar ke comedy track aur daily-life situations mein rahenge.

👥 SECOND GROUP / LARGE GANG

Second group ka final naam abhi lock nahi hai. T.T.D. sirf discussion example tha.

Is group ki gang story mein sabse badi gangs mein se ek hogi. Is group ka apna area aur territory hoga.

🥊 RIVALRY DEVELOPMENT

Rivalry beginning se existing nahi hogi. Player ke actions ke baad misunderstanding → confrontation → repeated incidents → growing dushmani ka progression hoga.

Player dono groups ke beech accidentally aur kabhi apni curiosity ke through situations create karega.

🎮 GAMEPLAY STORY STRUCTURE

Player free roam karega.

NPC interaction ke liye question button hoga.

Player NPC se apne mind mein aaye questions voice system ke through pooch sakega.

NPC answers story information, clues, funny reactions aur world details reveal karenge.

Story player ko fixed dialogue choices ya fixed movement path par force nahi karegi.

⭐ EASTER EGG DIRECTION

Story khud ek Easter Egg-style hidden experience hogi. Player chahe toh story discover karega, lekin world ko sirf story complete karne ke liye restrict nahi kiya jayega.

NPCs, hidden discoveries, funny situations aur recurring characters story ko discoverable banayenge.

🎵 ENDING CREDIT IDEA

Story complete hone ke baad final credits chalenge.

Credits mein creator ke alawa koi extra fake development team nahi dikhayi jayegi. Creator ka naam akela credit mein rahega.

Background mein DreamVerse ke liye banaya gaya original song chalega.

📝 BUILDING NOTES

- Player ko main hero mat banana.
- Dada Ji ko central elder character rakhna.
- Starting mein Dada Ji aur player ka encounter mat karwana.
- Dono groups ki starting mein koi purani dushmani mat rakhna.
- Player ki actions se rivalry gradually create karna.
- Dono groups ke separate areas/territories rakhna.
- Taj Mahal ko dedicated tourist/exploration landmark rakhna; uske aas-paas Agra city mat banana.
- Achabara Island ko separate location rakhna.
- Player ko free movement dena.
- Player dialogue fixed nahi honge.
- NPC question button + voice answer system story discovery ka main part hoga.
- Dada Ji ki 3-car entry preserve karna: left gang, centre Dada Ji, right gang.
- Dada Ji bonnet par relaxed entry pose mein honge.
- House encounter mein mehmaan wali desi cultural rule ko comedy ke saath use karna.
- Final second-group name baad mein decide karna.
